  "text": "AU$\nNZ$\nCA$\nEU\u20ac\nGB\u00a3\nJP\u00a5\nSG$\nHK$\nAE\u062f.\u0625\nMX$\nUS$\nHubble Knob Dark Emperador Marble\n\n$44.00\n\nFINISH:\nDark Emperador Marble\nSIZE: 40mm (1.57\") Small\n40MM (1.57\") SMALL\n60MM (2.36\") LARGE\n\nQUANTITY\n\n-\n+\nADD TO BAG \u2022 $44.00\n\nKey Features:\n\nEach knob is sold individually\nCrafted from Dark Emperador marble with a honed finish\nWarm chocolate brown base with gold and white veining\nNatural variation ensures every knob is unique\nSmooth spherical form with subtly curved edges\nAvailable in two sizes: 40mm (1.57\") small | 60mm (2.36\") large\nMounting hardware included\n\nA solid sphere of Dark Emperador marble, the Hubble Marble Knob is cool to the touch and weighty in the hand. The rich, warm tones of Dark Emperador beautifully complement the knob's simple, sculptural form, while delicate gold and white veining flows across the surface, making each piece naturally unique.\n\nPerfect for drawers and furniture pieces where a handle would feel oversized, the Hubble Marble Knob delivers the same striking stone presence in a more considered scale. Available in 40mm for lighter joinery and 60mm for a bolder statement.\n\nSmall: 40mm (1.57\") diameter x 35mm (1.38\") projection. Large: 60mm (2.36\") diameter x 55mm (2.17\") projection. Mounting hardware is included. Do not use electric tools during installation. Refer to the Specifications tab for the full installation guide.\n\nSpecifications\nShipping & Returns\nWarranty\n\nWe guarantee our products against structural defects for 5 years from the date of purchase. Defects in finishes, materials, and workmanship are guaranteed for 12 months.\n\nPlease note our marble and travertine products are unsealed. Damage, wear, or changes resulting from unprotected outdoor use, exposure to environmental conditions, or lack of maintenance are not covered under warranty. Lo & Co will replace any claim at its discretion.\n\nFor full terms, please review our Warranty via 